  m_Name: unit_850798
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Orthian Champion Avyn
  unitId: 850798
  unitNumber: 8602
  description: "Counterpart to the heavily augmented Void Walker known as Zenia,
    the young demigod Avyn is thought to be the echo of a life free from Gazia's
    ceaseless experimentation. While the others were molded after aspects of the
    almighty old gods\u2014whether destructive might or divine grace\u2014Avyn was
    granted the gift of traversing the boundaries between planes.Skilled with the
    sword, Avyn was initially assigned to the Athensphere army, but her unique talents
    caught the eye of the inventor demigod Azius. In what Giselle assumes to be a
    cross-plane resonance of unresolved desire, Avyn exhibits a strong yearning for
    shaping her own identity, as if to make up for the lack of one as Zenia.Indeed,
    these beliefs were of great interest to the inventor\u2014she was the closest
    to what Azius believed was the \"ideal form\", the cast-image of their progenitors
    who were wholly their own selves.These were beings beyond time who could see
    into other realms as they pleased, and in Avyn, he saw in her ability the potential
    to traverse (and eventually overcome) the Veil that separated their world from
    the \"other side.\"For Avyn, however, the greater calling at hand was to address
    the mounting unrest between the self-styled \"rulers\" of Athensphere. In their
    hubris, the demigods had chosen to subjugate one another to prove some arbitrary
    hierarchy, taking the people as collateral damage. Though considered the youngest
    among them, Avyn also possessed the strange quality of being the most empathetic
    toward the common folk.Little wonder she was able to gather candid support within
    the city, for the spirit of the living flesh is far greater than that of any
    machine."
  summonDesc: Have we met before?<br>No matter.<br>Any warrior against tyranny is
    a friend and ally to me!
  fusionDesc: Even if I remain the last one standing,<br>I will not surrender.
  evoDesc: Rise with me!<br>The fate of Athensphere shall be decided on this very
    day!
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
